    {
      "id": "fragment-behavior",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Behavior",
      "position": {
        "x": 2590,
        "y": -240
      },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "data": {
        "title": "Behavior",
        "body": "- Expand, collapse, and expand again from the same stand-in, which gives the same expansion and not a second copy.\n- An Expand/Collapse button on the Fragment's title bar expands and collapses.\n- While expanded, a Fragment whose piece has a ground becomes that ground: the card is hidden, the ground stands where it stood (an ordinary node, not a floor), and the edges that ran to the card run to the ground. Collapsing puts the card and its edges back, and saving keeps them as they were. A piece with no ground has nothing to land on, so its card stays and the nodes appear beside it.\n- A node an expansion brought in is read-only in the host. Where it sits and how big it is may change; nothing else does, and a delete is refused. The node says so, and to change it, open the piece.\n- A Fragment is not a way through: no click, double-click or workspace handle opens its graph. It draws a face of the other piece instead.\n- Refused: a piece outside the trust policy, with no stand-in back, with a different node id, whose stand-in back names another file, or that is not the file the host pinned.\n- A Method, Script, Import or Export in a piece arrives as a note, with no source and no Bridge, unless the stand-in allows its type.\n- Collapsing puts the host back as it was.\n- Evidence: `tests/fragmentSmoke.test.js` and the pair in `library/primitives/fragment/example/`.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "bridge",
          "updatedAt": 1791592070381,
          "reason": "bridge-reference"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-fragment"
        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
