        "title": "Where this lives",
        "body": "Source (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/GraphCrud.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/Nodes/PortNode.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/Nodes/expansionUtils.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/nodeSourceNavigation.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/fragmentGrants.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/reciprocalExpansionBridge.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/fragmentExtraction.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/fragmentSmoke.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior.",
